   'https://www.nu.edu.pk/Content/images/NU-logo.jpg', 'https://www.nu.edu.pk/Content/images/Slider/background.jpg', 11000, 'https://www.nu.edu.pk/',
   'admissions@nu.edu.pk', '+92-51-111-128-128')
ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE
