haar Scholarship Program, an initiative of the Punjab Higher Education Commission, aims to provide financial assistance to deserving and meritorious stu…","criteria":"The Honhaar Scholarship Program, an initiative of the Punjab Higher Education Commission, aims to provide financial assistance to deserving and meritorious students pursuing higher education at universities and colleges in Punjab, Pakistan."},{"name":"HEC Scholarships for MS and PhD students","type":"External","coverage":"The scholarship covers tuition fee, monthly stipend, and book allowance.","criteria":""},{"name":"OSAF Scholarships","type":"External","coverage":"OSAF (Old Students Association of FAST) arranges financial assistance for those students who cannot afford to pay their full fee.","criteria":""},{"name":"FANA Scholarship","type":"External","coverage":"FAST Alumni of North America provide funds for financial assistance for students who cannot afford to pay their full fee.","criteria":""},{"name":"Other Scholarships","type":null,"coverage":null,"criteria":""},{"name":"Ihsan Trust Financial Assistance","type":"External","coverage":null,"criteria":"Ihsan Trust Financial Assistance"},{"name":"Memon Community, Bohra Community, Agha Khan Foundation Scholarships","type":"External","coverage":null,"criteria":"Memon Community, Bohra Community, Agha Khan Foundation Scholarships"}]', NULL, '[{"label":"Application Forms Open","date":"2026-05-20"},{"label":"Application Deadline","date":"2026-06-30"},{"label":"Admission Test","date":"2026-06-29"},{"label":"Result Announcement","date":"2026-07-22"}]' FROM dual
